#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/08-errors-and-files.md:1178
msgid "Read `loans.csv` and write a log instead of [`print`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#print): one INFO line per stage with the number of loans ([`Counter`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html#collections.Counter), [lecture 7](./07-text-and-regex.md#counting-with-counter)), and a WARNING if more than 4% of the loans are in stage 3."
msgstr "Прочетете `loans.csv` и пишете log вместо [`print`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#print): по един INFO ред за всеки етап с броя на кредитите ([`Counter`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html#collections.Counter), [лекция 7](./07-text-and-regex.md#counting-with-counter)) и WARNING, ако повече от 4% от кредитите са в етап 3."

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/08-errors-and-files.md:1181
msgid "Add a second handler that also prints the WARNING lines on the screen. (Hint: [`logging.StreamHandler()`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/logging.handlers.html#logging.StreamHandler), [`setLevel`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/logging.html#logging.Logger.setLevel), [`log.addHandler`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/logging.html#logging.Logger.addHandler).)"
msgstr "Добавете втори handler, който показва и редовете WARNING на екрана. (Подсказка: [`logging.StreamHandler()`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/logging.handlers.html#logging.StreamHandler), [`setLevel`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/logging.html#logging.Logger.setLevel), [`log.addHandler`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/logging.html#logging.Logger.addHandler).)"

#. paragraph
#: site/lectures/08-errors-and-files.md:1216
msgid "The handler of `basicConfig` writes every line into the file; the second handler prints only the WARNING lines on the screen. Without `sys.stdout`, a `StreamHandler` writes to the error output (`sys.stderr`) - in the terminal you see it the same way."
msgstr "Handler-ът на `basicConfig` записва всеки ред във файла; вторият handler отпечатва на екрана само редовете WARNING. Без `sys.stdout` един `StreamHandler` пише в изхода за грешки (`sys.stderr`) - в терминала го виждате по същия начин."

#. heading 3
#: site/lectures/08-errors-and-files.md:1221
msgid "Excel files with `openpyxl`"
msgstr "Excel файлове с `openpyxl`"

#. heading 4
