#~ msgid "**With [`defaultdict`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html#collections.defaultdict).** [`defaultdict`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html#collections.defaultdict) (also from `collections`) does the [`get(..., 0.0)`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict.get) part for you. It is a dictionary that **creates a missing key** when you read it with `[]`. [`defaultdict(float)`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html#collections.defaultdict) gives the new key the value [`float()`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#float), which is `0.0`, so you can add to it straight away:"
#~ msgstr "**С [`defaultdict`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html#collections.defaultdict).** [`defaultdict`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html#collections.defaultdict) (също от `collections`) прави частта с [`get(..., 0.0)`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict.get) вместо вас. Това е dictionary, който **създава липсващ ключ**, когато го прочетете с `[]`. [`defaultdict(float)`](https://docs.python.org/3/library/collections.html#collections.defaultdict) дава на новия ключ стойността [`float()`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#float), която е `0.0`, така че можете веднага да добавяте към нея:"

#~ msgid "Pass `float`, not [`float()`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#float): the dictionary calls it for each new key. [`dict(totals)`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict) makes a normal dictionary with the same pairs. Round only after summing a group."
#~ msgstr "Подайте `float`, а не [`float()`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/functions.html#float): dictionary-то я извиква за всеки нов ключ. [`dict(totals)`](https://docs.python.org/3/builtins/stdtypes.html#dict) прави обикновен dictionary със същите двойки. Закръглявайте едва след като сумирате групата."

